# Artifacts cdd-kit writes into an ADOPTER repo. This repo is the kit itself:
# .claude/ is the source and assets/ is generated from it, so a manifest or an
# AGENTS.md produced here describes nothing and goes stale against package.json.
# They appear only when a kit command is run against this working copy.
